+      "teamsDeveloperPortalAppsSelectNewAppUnderConfigureApp": "<strong0>Teams Developer Portal · Apps</strong0>: select <strong1>New app</strong1>. Under <strong2>Configure · App features · Bot</strong2>, add an existing bot using the same Application ID; enable <strong3>Personal</strong3>, <strong4>Team</strong4>, and <strong5>Group chat</strong5> scopes plus file support. Under <strong6>Configure · Permissions</strong6>, add the two RSC <strong7>Application</strong7> permissions shown below. Complete the required app details and icons, explain that the app can receive every message in an installed team or group chat, then download the app package.",
